cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "AgentRewind: An undo log for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  AgentRewind records, for every action an AI agent takes, the action that would
  undo it, classifies actions as reversible, compensable or irreversible
  before they run, and rolls back whole agent sessions across the filesystem,
  git, cloud APIs and SaaS tools.
authors:
